===============================================================================
RECOMMENDED DELIVERY ORDER
===============================================================================

1. E1-E4: ko'rinadigan UI nuqsonlari va aniq copy/overflow muammolari.
2. M1-M2: theme va sekin internet resiliency.
3. M6-M7: counselor-school ownershipni barqarorlashtirish.
4. H3-H4-H6: Admin panel, counselor limit va data visibility.
5. H5: one-time credential va majburiy password change.
6. M3-M5 va H2-H9: task/roadmap/mission/Program Usage domain ishlari.
7. H1: Parent relationship va kabinet.
8. M8-M10: support, screen time va notification product qarori.
9. H7-H8: i18n va xavfsiz AI assistant.
10. H10: staging tekshiruvidan keyin Sirdaryo production migration.

